# Build artifacts only. Cargo.lock is deliberately RE-INCLUDED (the same
# rule as ../workspace/.gitignore): the repo root .gitignore ignores every
# non-root Cargo.lock, but this isolated bench workspace's lockfile is
# load-bearing: the iceoryx2 family must stay pinned =0.10.0 in lockstep
# with the repo lockfile (the binary<->cdylib skew class) and zenoh
# stays on the exact release Cargo.toml pins (1.10.1, the one
# cerulion_core depends on). PITFALLS.md tells readers to grep BOTH lockfiles as in-repo
# artifacts, which is only true if this one is tracked.
/target/
!Cargo.lock
